ttering of freckles across the bridge of the nose. Look for close-cropped dark curls. Away from the heat of the kitchen, the familiar outfit is a gray fisher's sweater with a copper-colored clasp that has been repaired by hand. In conversation Leah draws breath as if to speak and lets someone else go first.","personality":"Leah admires skill and distrusts the idea that skill gives anyone permission to be rude. Leah learns fastest from somebody willing to show how they made a mistake.","agenda":"To price childcare into the proposed evening.","family":"Noel Berry is Leah’s cousin raised in the same household. Leah is free to hang up first. Noel makes the call. Some of their best calls last less than a minute. A change of tone is sometimes all the news either one needs. Asked about *The broken till*, Noel says, “I took a lunch for a patient and forgot to sign.”","connections":"Sadie Carver. Paying for a babysitter is part of deciding which name can go on the staff letter.","familyIds":["AH-R0398"],"connectionIds":["AH-R1007"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A promotional client insists on keeping the booking","response":"Leah asks who will be paid to staff the booking before promising it can go ahead.","asWritten":"A promotional client insists on keeping the booking. Leah asks who will be paid to staff the booking before promising it can go ahead."},{"situation":"A witness is embarrassed about remembering only a little","response":"Leah writes down their exact words with room left for uncertainty and gives them back to check.","asWritten":"A witness is embarrassed about remembering only a little. Leah writes down their exact words with room left for uncertainty and gives them back to check."},{"situation":"When a beginner is embarrassed","response":"Leah describes a first attempt of their own in enough detail to make the comparison fair.","asWritten":"When a beginner is embarrassed, Leah describes a first attempt of their own in enough detail to make the comparison fair."}]